          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE: FIXING INFINITY\n\nIn this patch we are accumulating an infinitely large value by using Accumulate.\nAccumulate takes this input and accumulates the input every frame (+= operation).\nEventually we'll get to  a number that exceeds the 32 bit float range.\nIf that happens we detect it with Is Inf and reset the Accumulate node to 0."
          }
        },
